    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You put the horn to your lips, or simply fill your lungs, and let loose a sound that breaks the enemy advance.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Maneuver</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Guile</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Every enemy within 5 squares that can hear you.</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>Conditions use normal decay.</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>None.</dd></div><div><dt>Limits</dt><dd>Repeatable; normal action economy applies.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Signature</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>apply Frightened 1.</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>apply Frightened 1 and Dazed 1.</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>apply Frightened 2 and Dazed 1.</dd></dl></div><h3>Additional rulings</h3><p><strong>Tags:</strong> Skill / Control</p><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/signature-leader-hold-your-nerve.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/signature-leader-hold-your-nerve.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
